DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The ppoossiixx__ssppaawwnnaattttrr__ggeettssiiggmmaasskk() function obtains the value of the spawn-
     sigmask attribute from the attributes object referenced by _a_t_t_r.

     The ppoossiixx__ssppaawwnnaattttrr__sseettssiiggmmaasskk() function sets the spawn-sigmask attri‐
     bute in an initialized attributes object referenced by _a_t_t_r.

     The spawn-sigmask attribute represents the signal mask in effect in the
     new process image of a spawn operation (if POSIX_SPAWN_SETSIGMASK is set
     in the spawn-flags attribute).  The default value of this attribute is
     unspecified.

